<title>RUSSIA: Russian March unemployment rises to 9.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian March unemployment rises to 9.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Russia rose to 6.99 million, or 9.6 percent of the workforce, at the end of March from 6.94 million in February, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 Mar 97     Feb 97     Mar 96</p>
<p>    number unemployed (million)	6.99	 6.94	 6.48</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	9.60	 9.50	 8.80</p>
<p>    officially registered (million)  2.56	 2.55	 2.68</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for total unemployed are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
